be-jaavsb (Iter[T] design) extracts `buildSearchClause` from `SearchIssues` in PG. This bead reuses that helper. **Land order:** be-jaavsb's PR first (or the helper extraction is part of this bead's PR if be-jaavsb hasn't merged yet — talk to pm for sequencing). If be-jaavsb's helper is unavailable when this bead's PR is in flight, this bead can land its own duplicate of the SQL filter logic and be-jaavsb can deduplicate when it lands.

